<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>BeerJS Madrid</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Somos una gran comunidad de programadores con ganas de juntarse en un entorno relajado, para conocerse y conversar."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono&display=swap"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img src="/beerjs-mug.svg" alt="Jarra BeerJS" width="638" height="741" />
      <div class="copy">
        <h1>BeerJS <em>Madrid</em></h1>
        <p>
          Somos una gran comunidad de programadores con ganas de juntarse en un
          entorno relajado, para conocerse y conversar.
        </p>
        <div class="next">
          <span>¿Cuándo es el próximo?</span>
          <a href="https://www.meetup.com/">
            Ver en Meetup
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 7h10v10" /><path d="M7 17 17 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  /* ponytail: only the Build in Madrid tokens this page uses, inlined instead of the full DS bundle */
  :root {
    --garnet: #792e29;
    --garnet-600: #682723;
    --garnet-400: #a55850;
    --sand-50: #f4f2ec;
    --text-heading: #24201d;
    --text-body: #332f2a;
    --text-muted: #6b665a;
    --border-hairline: rgba(36, 32, 29, 0.14);
    --font-display: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --font-sans: "Space Grotesk", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }

  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    background: var(--sand-50);
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 32px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr));
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
    height: auto;
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--garnet);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .next {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .next span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--garnet);
  }

  .next a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0 28px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--sand-50);
    background: var(--garnet);
    border: 1px solid var(--garnet);
    border-radius: 5px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 140ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.25, 1);
  }

  .next a:hover {
    background: var(--garnet-600);
    border-color: var(--garnet-600);
  }

  .next a:active {
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  .next a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--garnet-400);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
